# Reference databases: freely available but not redistributable.
# ChEBI is fetched by scripts/database_matches.py; HMDB must be downloaded by
# hand from https://www.hmdb.ca/downloads (the "Structures" SDF).
OriginalData/reference_databases/**
!OriginalData/reference_databases/
!OriginalData/reference_databases/README.md

# The pH 7.0, 9.0 and 11.0 energy files exist only to build SI Table 3, which is
# itself deposited. They are 128 MB and are regenerated by the command in
# ProcessedData/SI/README.md. The pH 7.4 set is kept, being the basis of every
# pathway result here.
ProcessedData/SI/full/*_pH7.0.csv
ProcessedData/SI/full/*_pH9.0.csv
ProcessedData/SI/full/*_pH11.0.csv
